00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:59.900
Regardless of whether we're talking business
economics, whether we're talking politics,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.909
whether we're talking interpersonal relationships.

00:02:02.909 --> 00:02:13.410
He has the ability to harm and abuse and to
always escape the consequences or almost always

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.620
